     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Platelets:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " check before and periodically during heparin; thrombocytopenia occurs in up to 30%, 2–20 days (average 5–9) after starting. If platelets fall below 100,000 or thrombosis recurs, stop heparin and evaluate for HIT; HIT can occur up to several weeks after heparin is stopped."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Enoxaparin with CrCl < 30 mL/min:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " treatment doses become 1 mg/kg SC once daily."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Boxed warning (LMWH):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " epidural or spinal hematomas with neuraxial anesthesia or spinal puncture, which may cause long-term or permanent paralysis."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
